  <h2>Commercial formats</h2>
  <p>Available formats may include premium display placements, section sponsorships, newsletter sponsorships and clearly identified branded work. Placement depends on availability, context and whether the proposal belongs within the character of the publication.</p>
  <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
  <p>No commercial arrangement purchases favorable coverage, silence, or undisclosed influence over editorial treatment. Paid material must declare itself before the reader is asked to engage with it.</p>
  <h2>Measurement</h2>
  <p>Nuvellum reports only the audience and campaign measures it can substantiate. Reach, engagement and outcomes are not embellished for the sake of a proposal.</p>
  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>For advertising, sponsorship, partnerships or rights enquiries, write to <a href="mailto:sam@nuvellum.news?subject=Advertising%20and%20partnerships">sam@nuvellum.news</a>.</p>
